.TH LT-QWWAD_EF_DONOR_SPECIFIC "1" "September 2016" "lt-qwwad_ef_donor_specific (Quantum Wells, Wires and Dots) 1.5.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lt-qwwad_ef_donor_specific \- find ground state of electron orbiting a donor ion in a heterostructure.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lt-qwwad_ef_donor_specific
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find state of electron attached to a donor in a 2D system
.SH OPTIONS

